{"id":"6f147e99a04e0c46","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-map-inverse-map.md","title":"ZFC Map Inverse Map","display":"df-zfc-map-inverse-map — ZFC Map Inverse Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-map-inverse-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-map-inverse-map"],"display":"df-zfc-map-inverse-map — ZFC Map Inverse Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-map-inverse-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-map-inverse-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-map-inverse-map — ZFC Map Inverse Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (bijection predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMapInverseMap}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMapInverseMap}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}map\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapInverseMap}_S(g,f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(g(f(x))=x)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(f(g(y))=y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}map\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapInverseMap}_S(g,f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Y,X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(g(f(x))=x)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(f(g(y))=y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md